  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>뀋<ruby>에<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> <ruby>즈<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby><ruby>데<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span> (<span>뀋<ruby>에<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>주<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>데<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></span>)</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HneYLDOpwlg?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">以拼音／注音快速辨識本站所標註的<a href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/zh-tw-tangliengim/\">聲調</a><br>Quick <a href=\"/learn/introduction/\">tone</a> guide to this site&#8217;s tone markings through Pinyin/Zhuyin</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>â ≈ ā / ㄚ<br><strong>á</strong> ≈ á / ㄚˊ</strong><br><strong><strong>ǎ</strong> ≈ ǎ / ㄚˇ<br><strong>à</strong> ≈ à / ㄚˋ</strong><br><strong><br>a ≈ ǎ / ㄚˇ</strong><br><strong><strong>ā</strong> ≈ ǎ / ㄚˇ</strong>, <em>但音再高一些 ; with a slightly higher pitch</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">潮汕話 Teochew</h4>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>月圓暝<rt>뀋일메ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>孤影<rt>거ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>起<rt>키ˊ-</rt></ruby><ruby>爐火<rt>러훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gueh-ḭ-mê kōr-yà̰ khí-lor-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>日子<rt>찓즈ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>悄悄<rt>ᄎᆤˉᄎᆤˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"yu\">又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>添歲<rt>턈ˉ쉐ˇ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jsit-j̀ chiāu-chiāu yu-thiām-suě\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上好<rt>샹호ˊ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人家<rt>낭게ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>底塊<rt>디거ˇ</rt></ruby> <ruby>揣<rt>췌</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siang-hó-nang-kē ti-kǒr chue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>暝深<rt>메침ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮茶<rt>즈ˊ데ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    me-chīm kā-ki lai-j́-tê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>靜待<rt>젤태-</rt></ruby><ruby>好水<rt>호ˊ쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>配好茶<rt>풰ˆ호ˊ데ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jḛ-thai-hó-jùi phuê-hó-tê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>風<rt>황ˉ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby>輕輕<rt>킨ˉ킨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>吹<rt>췌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoāng’ah khīn-khīn-chuē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>舅妗姑姨<rt>구김거ˊ이ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>忙<rt>망-</rt></ruby><ruby>催嫁<rt>취ˉ게ˇ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ku-kim-kór-î mang-chūi-kě\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby>譜<rt>퍼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>彈<rt>돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>琵琶<rt>비베ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-lái bo-phòr toa̰-pi-pê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>月下<rt>뀋에ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>花<rt>훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>花<rt>훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>未應<rt>쀄엥ˇ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gueh-é mng-huē huē bue-ěng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>花容月貌<rt>훼ˉ영뀋ᄆᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>去<rt>크ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>不回<rt>붇ˆ훼ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huē-yong-gueh-máu k̂h-pût-huê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>終將<rt>정ˉ쟝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>成<rt>셍-</rt></ruby><ruby>落花<rt>롷훼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huē jōng-jiāng-seng-loh-huē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>觸景生情<rt>척ˆ겡ˊ셀ˉ쳉ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chôrk-kéng-sḛ̄-chêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>身<rt>신ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt>도-</rt></ruby><ruby>何處<rt>호추ˇ</rt></ruby> <ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˆ니게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīn to-ho-chǔ siâu-ni-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄀᅷˆ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>誰<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huē kâu-toè loh-sui-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>와<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>願<rt>ᅙᅪᆼ-</rt></ruby><ruby>今暝<rt>김ˉ메ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>르<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>쇨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>즈ˊ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>茶<rt>데ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oà ngoang-kīm-mê wi-l̀ soḛ̄-j́-jek-puē-tê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jek-puē yu-jek-puē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>身<rt>신ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt>도-</rt></ruby><ruby>何處<rt>호추ˇ</rt></ruby> <ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˆ니게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīn to-ho-chǔ siâu-ni-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄀᅷˆ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>誰<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huē kâu-toè loh-sui-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>와<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>願<rt>ᅙᅪᆼ-</rt></ruby><ruby>今生<rt>김ˉ셍ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>르<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>쇨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>즈ˊ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>茶<rt>데ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oà ngoang-kīm-sēng wi-l̀ soḛ̄-j́-jek-puē-tê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jek-puē yu-jek-puē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>舅妗姑姨<rt>구김거ˊ이ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>忙<rt>망-</rt></ruby><ruby>催嫁<rt>취ˉ게ˇ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ku-kim-kór-î mang-chūi-kě\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby>譜<rt>퍼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>彈<rt>돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>琵琶<rt>비베ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-lái bo-phòr toa̰-pi-pê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>月下<rt>뀋에ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>花<rt>훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>花<rt>훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>未應<rt>쀄엥ˇ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gueh-é mng-huē huē bue-ěng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>花容月貌<rt>훼ˉ영뀋ᄆᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>去<rt>크ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>不回<rt>붇ˆ훼ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huē-yong-gueh-máu k̂h-pût-huê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>終將<rt>정ˉ쟝ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>成<rt>셍-</rt></ruby><ruby>落花<rt>롷훼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huē jōng-jiāng-seng-loh-huē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>觸景生情<rt>척ˆ겡ˊ셀ˉ쳉ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chôrk-kéng-sḛ̄-chêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>身<rt>신ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt>도-</rt></ruby><ruby>何處<rt>호추ˇ</rt></ruby> <ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˆ니게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīn to-ho-chǔ siâu-ni-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄀᅷˆ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>誰<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huē kâu-toè loh-sui-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>와<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>願<rt>ᅙᅪᆼ-</rt></ruby><ruby>今暝<rt>김ˉ메ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>르<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>쇨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>즈ˊ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>茶<rt>데ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oà ngoang-kīm-mê wi-l̀ soḛ̄-j́-jek-puē-tê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jek-puē yu-jek-puē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>身<rt>신ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>在<rt>도-</rt></ruby><ruby>何處<rt>호추ˇ</rt></ruby> <ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˆ니게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīn to-ho-chǔ siâu-ni-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄀᅷˆ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>誰<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huē kâu-toè loh-sui-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>와<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>願<rt>ᅙᅪᆼ-</rt></ruby><ruby>今生<rt>김ˉ셍ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>르<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>쇨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>즈ˊ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>茶<rt>데ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oà ngoang-kīm-sēng wi-l̀ soḛ̄-j́-jek-puē-tê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>젝붸ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jek-puē yu-jek-puē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">泉漳話翻譯 Hokkien translation</h4>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>月圓暝<rt>뀋일미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>孤影<rt>거ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>起<rt>키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>爐火<rt>러훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gueh-ḭ-mí kōr-yà̰ khî-lor-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>日子<rt>띧즤ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>悄悄<rt>ᄎᆤˉᄎᆤˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"yu\">又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>添歲<rt>턈ˉ쉐</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rit-jì chiāu-chiâu yu-thiām-sue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上好<rt>셩호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人家<rt>랑게ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>揣<rt>췌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siong-hô-lang-kê tô-wī chuē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>暝深<rt>미침ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮茶<rt>주ˆ데ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    mi-chîm kā-kī lai-jû-té\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>靜待<rt>졩태-</rt></ruby><ruby>好水<rt>호ˆ쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>配<rt>풰ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好茶<rt>호ˆ데ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jieng-thai-hô-jùi phuè-hô-té\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby>輕輕<rt>킨ˉ킨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>吹<rt>췌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hông’ah khīn-khīn-chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>舅妗姑姨<rt>구김거ˆ이ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>忙<rt>빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>催嫁<rt>취ˉ게</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ku-kim-kôr-í bang-chūi-ke\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby>譜<rt>퍼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>彈<rt>돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>琵琶<rt>비베ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-lāi bo-phòr toa̰-pi-pé\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>月下<rt>뀋에ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>未應<rt>쀄옝</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gueh-ē mng-huê huê bue-yeng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>花容月貌<rt>화ˉ영꽏ᄆᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>不回<rt>붇ˆ훼ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoā-yong-goat-māu khì-pût-hué\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>終歸<rt>졍ˉ귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>成<rt>솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>落花<rt>락ˆ훼ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huê jiōng-kūi-sieng-lâk-huê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>觸景生情<rt>쳑ˆ곙ˆ실ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiôrk-kiêng-sḭ̄-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>身<rt>신ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>何處<rt>호추</rt></ruby> <ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sîn ti-ho-chu siàu-lien-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˋ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>誰<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huê tàu-toè loh-sui-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>願<rt>꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>今暝<rt>긴ˉ미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>솅ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>주ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>茶<rt>데ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà goan-kīn-mí wi-lì siēng-jû-jit-puē-té\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-puê yu-jit-puê\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>身<rt>신ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>何處<rt>호추</rt></ruby> <ruby>少年家<rt>ᄉᆤˋ롄게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sîn ti-ho-chu siàu-lien-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>繁花<rt>환훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˋ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>誰<rt>쉬-</rt></ruby><ruby>家<rt>게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-huê tàu-toè loh-sui-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>願<rt>꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>今生<rt>김ˉ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>先<rt>솅ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>주ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>茶<rt>데ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà goan-kīm-siêng wi-lì siēng-jû-jit-puē-té\n  </span>\n</p>\n\